      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we have some go tools that run as part of the build and depend on soong-first libraries. `dexpreopt_gen` seems to be one of them.\n\nI looked at its usages in the ninja file, and ran the command directly\n```\n$ out/host/linux-x86/bin/dexpreopt_gen -o tmpfile \u003csome_args\u003e\n```\n\nI then replaced this with the bazel built one, and ran the command again\n```\n$ bazel-bin/build/soong/dexpreopt/dexpreopt_gen/dexpreopt_gen_/dexpreopt_gen -o tmpfile \u003csome_args\u003e\n```\n\nThe resultant `tmpfile` is bit identical, which leads me to believe in the example of `dexpreopt_gen` the the coupling might be a loose one. OTOH, there might be some other tools where this might not be the case.\n\nI have filed b/293340017 to keep track of potential issues that might arise out of this dependency.",
